[I] Console-based network traffic monitor

[T] vnStat is a console-based network traffic monitor that uses the
[T] interface statistics provided by the kernel instead of sniffing traffic,
[T] keeping system resource usage low. It keeps five minute, hourly, daily,
[T] monthly and yearly statistics with configurable retention, and can
[T] optionally output images using the GD library.

[U] https://humdi.net/vnstat

[A] Vnstat Authors
